# Markdown docs are internal / not shipped, EXCEPT the repo README and CHANGELOG.
# (CHANGELOG.md is rewritten + committed by the release git-sequence, so it must stay tracked.)
# Covers audit.md, docs/*.md, claude.md, and any future internal *.md.
*.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md

# Local saved variables (if you symlink your WTF for testing)
WTF/
SavedVariables/
